---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Hearth · AI 에이전트가 직접 움직이는 워크스페이스"
  description="Claude Code와 Codex용 Hearth Skill로 AI 에이전트가 프로젝트, 메모, 일정을 직접 정리하는 로컬 워크스페이스."
  locale="ko"
  path="/"
>
  <section data-home class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-16 pt-20 md:px-12 md:pb-24 md:pt-28">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr] lg:gap-14">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-paper/55">Hearth 1.1 · macOS</p>
          <h1 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2.55rem,5.4vw,5rem)] font-extralight leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.045em]">
            AI 에이전트가<br/>Hearth를 움직입니다.
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/72 md:text-xl">
            Claude Code와 Codex에 Hearth Skill을 연결하세요. 말 한마디가 프로젝트, 메모, 일정이 되고 열려 있는 Hearth에 바로 나타납니다.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/hearth/id6764480247?mt=12" class="rounded-xl bg-paper px-6 py-3.5 text-center font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-bone">Mac App Store에서 구매</a>
            <a href="/ko/install/skill" class="rounded-xl border border-paper/30 px-6 py-3.5 text-center font-medium text-paper transition-colors hover:border-paper">Hearth Skill 설치</a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-paper/50">Claude Code · Codex · 한 번 구매 · 로컬 SQLite</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/ko/01-workspace.webp" alt="Hearth 1.1 프로젝트 화면" width="1600" height="1000" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-paper/10" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="agent" data-home class="bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-[0.88fr_1.12fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">AI Agent + Hearth Skill</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">말하면,<br/>워크스페이스가 바뀝니다.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Hearth Skill은 자연어 요청을 전용 CLI 명령으로 바꿉니다. 에이전트가 프로젝트를 만들고 메모를 연결하고 일정을 등록하면, 앱이 변경 사항을 즉시 보여줍니다.</p>
        <a href="/ko/install/skill" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-xl bg-ink px-6 py-3.5 font-medium text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-ink/85">Hearth Skill 설치 방법</a>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-ink p-6 text-paper shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-ink/10 md:p-9">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-paper/10 pb-5">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-ember px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white">HEARTH SKILL</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-paper/40">CLAUDE CODE / CODEX</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-7 text-xl leading-relaxed">“오늘 작업한 PR을 새 프로젝트로 정리하고, 내일 오후 3시 리뷰 일정을 잡아줘.”</p>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-3 font-mono text-sm">
          <p class="rounded-xl bg-paper/5 px-4 py-3 text-ember">hearth project create</p>
          <p class="rounded-xl bg-paper/5 px-4 py-3 text-ember">hearth memo create</p>
          <p class="rounded-xl bg-paper/5 px-4 py-3 text-ember">hearth schedule create</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-7 grid gap-3 text-sm text-paper/70 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <p>✓ 프로젝트 생성</p><p>✓ 메모 연결</p><p>✓ 일정 등록</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="hearth-11" data-home class="bg-bone">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">Built around the real work</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">기록하고, 배치하고, 돌아보는 흐름.</h2>
      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white/55 ring-1 ring-ink/10">
          <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/ko/02-capture.webp" alt="Hearth 메모보드와 빠른 기록" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full" />
          <div class="p-7 md:p-9"><h3 class="text-2xl font-medium">생각난 순간 바로 기록</h3><p class="mt-3 text-ink/65">메모보드에 쌓고, 저널에서 하루의 흐름으로 다시 봅니다.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white/55 ring-1 ring-ink/10">
          <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/ko/03-calendar.webp" alt="Hearth 1.1 월간 캘린더" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full" />
          <div class="p-7 md:p-9"><h3 class="text-2xl font-medium">한 달을 한눈에</h3><p class="mt-3 text-ink/65">일정 종류, 색상, 아이콘으로 맥락까지 놓치지 않습니다.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-home class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-paper/50">Calendar, in motion</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">잡아서 옮기면<br/>일정 변경 끝.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/65">커서를 따라오는 부드러운 프리뷰를 보며 원하는 날짜에 정확히 놓으세요.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/ko/04-drag.webp" alt="Hearth 캘린더 드래그 일정 변경" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-paper/10" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-home class="bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/ko/05-local.webp" alt="Hearth 저널과 로컬 데이터" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-ink/10" />
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">Local-first, by default</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">가입도 구독도<br/>없습니다.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65">프로젝트, 메모, 일정은 내 Mac의 SQLite 파일에 저장됩니다. 직접 백업하고 옮길 수 있습니다.</p>
        <p class="mt-6 break-all rounded-xl bg-ink/5 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-ink/70">~/Library/Application Support/com.codewithgenie.hearth/data.db</p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink/55">Hearth Skill은 Claude Code·Codex에서 동작합니다. 앱 내 OpenAI 연동은 별도의 선택 기능입니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-home class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 md:px-12 md:py-28 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-paper/50">Your agent. Your workspace.</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)] font-light leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">AI 에이전트가 실제로 쓰는 작업실.</h2>
      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/hearth/id6764480247?mt=12" class="mt-10 inline-block rounded-xl bg-paper px-7 py-4 font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-bone">Mac App Store에서 구매</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
